.TH WELLPOWER 1 "2026" "wellutils 1.4.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
wellpower \- battery health and power management overview
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wellpower
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Battery charge and wear (full-charge vs design capacity), cycle count,
AC adapter state, current draw in watts, charge thresholds and the active
power profile (power-profiles-daemon, platform_profile or TLP).
On machines without a battery every section degrades gracefully.
.SH OPTIONS
See wellutils(1) for the shared option set. \fB\-\-short\fR prints a single
line such as \fI85%+ (wear 7%)\fR suitable for status bars.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 success, 2 bad CLI usage, 3 runtime error.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tlp (8),
.BR wellutils (1)
